OL,3,ADemocratic rising star Ossoff projected
OL,4,Ato hold Georgia seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocratic Senator Jon Ossoff is
OL,7,Fprojected to have won re-election in
OL,8,FGeorgia, defeating Republican
OL,9,Fchallenger Mike Collins and pushing the
OL,10,Fcrucial swing state deeper into
OL,11,FDemocratic control.
OL,13,FOssoff, a rising star in the Democratic
OL,14,FParty, portrayed his opponent as loyal
OL,15,Fto a "failed president" and made the
OL,16,Frising cost of living a central issue
OL,17,Fin the campaign. Georgia voted for
OL,18,FDonald Trump in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
